<title>POLAND: Polish shares mixed in Warsaw continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares mixed in Warsaw continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The share prices of BRE, Budimex and Elektrim rose, those of Stalexport fell while BIG, Debica and Universal shares were flat in a 5,7-million zloty turnover on Thursday, up from Wednesday's 1.6-million turnover.</p>
<p>NFI units fell 2.4 percent to 144 zlotys. Their turnover eased to 17.9 million zlotys from Wednesday's 20.2 million.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
